\dot{\vect P}=-m_2e\omega^2(\sin\omega t,\cos\omega t).
\]
支承合力 $\vect N$ 与重力满足
$\vect N-(m_1+m_2)g\vect e_y=\dot{\vect P}$，故
\begin{equation}
